cutor-type and --isolated, but\n`ros2 component standalone` had no way to pass them, so a component run\nthis way always got the default single-threaded executor. Forward both\noptions to the container.\n\nAlso select the container executable by exact name. The previous\nsubstring match could pick a deprecated variant such as\ncomponent_container_mt, depending on file order.\n\nSigned-off-by: Maurice <mauricepurnawan@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "92c0e2945dac4b6d0cdff392fa8579191ef6884b", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/git/trees/92c0e2945dac4b6d0cdff392fa8579191ef6884b"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/git/commits/6ea36ec794184c1bb59b75fd7874e946c98cf756", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvr7ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOx8QAG+tdUYYIrUwcQgGHAS8I71B\ntqcXAFpBINQnMgHuyt6Iqrbqebqn0Ag4/iGuUayR19cHtaIe1ccR6a+e48vPFoRU\nTMSGfNup5WpoTXD7QyFC0I+fGwHYhT4yDMjcgIgGndNUhJbBaQWvckaCRA10t2hw\npr3U0XOgIXETZeoAXaz7SMi98/1r62SehDtB/X7oQtU19wAlUwuUND9gMl5dRJPo\nwOwpOzgryrr4NpYKQldQjdbj8TTo5QVWkJjOAC3oblRv1iS7E5rf+zVDc/rsLCpJ\nw2HuuzrETu2j7p514U1QPxownxctgoTueMQbChfdHwgevyGra7C2ukQ2G+iZKqKf\nVX9u0TMEc/DHAPNVOistyJFq0+4Fl0ZEtKSblhllqgoiBWiTz5X6L4LWWYES/a0s\naYy144/WkQHpbs2CKc+bPxoGEGObKhDzBdWSyNBax0KlVRZ78vbSxnwTS+UifThQ\nRpjPLwhcc3eNL0tsNefNeE/Sqg1DnCekxALdGbonOWx/HFQCfXPv2Bkq715FMkrt\nvhygLprvia+BRimXsA7umEG+obhDGqYK2OqCzVueSpS1KIepWGFGsUW/ON8gwDGe\nb4sDnkA/PhTqhZdgZHz+MvKSklEvn+PwA0GlwjKh9cDopvxR3p7TnY8/w58wCzCN\ncYb7rBNrKHikii7OV5hr\n=+jBV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 92c0e2945dac4b6d0cdff392fa8579191ef6884b\nparent 6dbc8972f82aea5fbb15900ae2a9f224f4f3b622\nauthor Maurice Alexander Purnawan <mauricepurnawan@gmail.com> 1790885576 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790885576 -0700\n\nAdd --executor-type and --isolated to ros2 component standalone (#1310)\n\ncomponent_container accepts --executor-type and --isolated, but\n`ros2 component standalone` had no way to pass them, so a component run\nthis way always got the default single-threaded executor. Forward both\noptions to the container.\n\nAlso select the container executable by exact name. The previous\nsubstring match could pick a deprecated variant such as\ncomponent_container_mt, depending on file order.\n\nSigned-off-by: Maurice <mauricepurnawan@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "verified_at": "2026-10-01T20:12:57Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/commits/6ea36ec794184c1bb59b75fd7874e946c98cf756", "html_url": "https://github.com/ros2/ros2cli/commit/6ea36ec794184c1bb59b75fd7874e946c98cf756", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/commits/6ea36ec794184c1bb59b75fd7874e946c98cf756/comments", "author": {"login": "mini-1235", "id": 58433591, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDMzNTkx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58433591?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235", "html_url": "https://github.com/mini-1235", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mini-1235/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.co