mZjYzY", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Usama Jahangir", "email": "67747435+usamajahangir@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T16:50:23Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-29T16:50:23Z"}, "message": "Fix/interface show suffix match (#1315)\n\n* Fix ros2 interface show matching interfaces by name suffix\n\nThe interface file lookup used endswith(), so e.g.\nvisualization_msgs/msg/Marker could resolve to msg/ImageMarker.msg\ndepending on the order of the resource index. Match the file name\nexactly instead, which still supports non-standard interface locations.\n\nFixes #1311\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>\n\n* Add test for ros2 interface show with name suffix collision\n\ntest_msgs/msg/Nested is a suffix of test_msgs/msg/MultiNested; make\nsure the correct definition is shown.\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "49b8ddcaa261f5b94778d2ec7fda5b026b40501a", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/git/trees/49b8ddcaa261f5b94778d2ec7fda5b026b40501a"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/git/commits/1976d163279615def79db73810128aca6babfcc6", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu+xPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALmAQAKSyi1Mnqtw/F0IihDmyLyBk\nNj05clfAPp4TZdR9YeZ2Ce23i9kvrczEM+Y8MnWG0XoflcEsRP8gTFNCaNDRWbLV\nZ6YbZbrAVvznHY3VHzOepmVN2dsL6r85oh9sqUipxSOVTJXfFgalVc6GvHI/lOCz\nVVyiK12GJ5tOz1B+Ftn66PqYu+TRFZvxR6ArKl7IkmhbLq8QoxT7NOjq4/atZFPV\nIhDSQ8vHpYcL2Ccacz/DS3NV1m4R9uyhBIOckjt9gVOD+Gew78v2GXbt5A6CaMoQ\nNsUa4MG0YJxwCeOEqtms/h5YcjzM6bsbwGKr+JZ0SMX+vDf/hs2QKEa9seWzdeK3\nldLaNqKUOe7wXNLiTYtu3QR49J05g99mJuEQBEDVsd7ZWt2apJ1Xbkr+qskfZfuq\n2NBLoApZO37fEzK1En6rsrlzRKe7+OYPt8Z+eZ8uVBLePRMFraM8axqDPqxSrYsl\neXZoL6Xk9h17rvGIqDYkP020TysCxNuDSCo7j4U/57ZutfD0C7110HYNlx/nD1pg\n6h8+B7Xn3UjBTyJhNEGX+hlCN5U5Cp/dEWWunJl3vXa/82WIeVI24/itny2J9Ivq\nbYQzHZZZbfcrRTOgon9zTTxjvAWDFWHRt43ConDplJDOyeEExEaHiyOT/I4fYkx1\nf8G813HDwMM287UJiCC0\n=5GJN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 49b8ddcaa261f5b94778d2ec7fda5b026b40501a\nparent 1e7f0158c0eea01f63672d4b7f06ee277899e6c0\nauthor Usama Jahangir <67747435+usamajahangir@users.noreply.github.com> 1790700623 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790700623 -0700\n\nFix/interface show suffix match (#1315)\n\n* Fix ros2 interface show matching interfaces by name suffix\n\nThe interface file lookup used endswith(), so e.g.\nvisualization_msgs/msg/Marker could resolve to msg/ImageMarker.msg\ndepending on the order of the resource index. Match the file name\nexactly instead, which still supports non-standard interface locations.\n\nFixes #1311\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>\n\n* Add test for ros2 interface show with name suffix collision\n\ntest_msgs/msg/Nested is a suffix of test_msgs/msg/MultiNested; make\nsure the correct definition is shown.\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Usama Jahangir <mr.usama.jahangir@gmail.com>", "verified_at": "2026-09-29T16:50:23Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/commits/1976d163279615def79db73810128aca6babfcc6", "html_url": "https://github.com/ros2/ros2cli/commit/1976d163279615def79db73810128aca6babfcc6", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2/ros2cli/commits/1976d163279615def79db73810128aca6babfcc6/comments", "author": {"login": "usamajahangir", "id": 67747435, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY3NzQ3NDM1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67747435?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/usamajahangir", "html_url": "https://github.com/usamajahangir", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/usamajahangir/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/usamajahangir/following{/other_user